!! Which version should I use?

|!Version |!Soil dynamics |!Crowding |!Use it to |
|[[Baseline]] |off |off |reproduce the published model with the fixes applied |
|[[Soil]] |on (sliders) |off |study depletion and recovery of soil quality |
|[[Crowding]] |off |on (sliders) |study plot sharing under land scarcity |
|[[Combined]] |switch `soil-on?` |switch `crowding-on?` |compare all four configurations in one file |

New to the model? Read [[Getting started]]. Background on the original model and what the paper found is on the [[Janssen CoMSES Model]] page.
